Package: validateR
Title: Simple Data Frame Validation and Quality Checks
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Ugyen", "Norbu", , "unorbu2019@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a simple set of functions to check data frames for
    common data quality issues, including missing values, outliers,
    inconsistent types, and duplicate rows. Results are returned as a
    structured report object with print and plot methods.
